"d":8,"tag":"p","x":56,"y":846,"w":278,"h":134,"text":"Consumer brands run ten or more disconnected tools to manage their customers. We collapse that stack into one agent. Support first, then shopping, then social, then everywhere else a customer turns up.","s":{"font":"Instrument Sans 500 16px/22.4px ls:-0.16px","color":"rgb(18, 32, 35)","ta":"left"}},{"d":8,"tag":"p","x":56,"y":1001,"w":278,"h":157,"text":"Hundreds of brands already run real customer volume on Siena in production. What you build here reaches their customers the same week. The system is live, people depend on it, and it is nowhere near finished.","s":{"font":"Instrument Sans 500 16px/22.4px ls:-0.16px","color":"rgb(18, 32, 35)","ta":"left"}},{"d":8,"tag":"p","x":56,"y":1178,"w":278,"h":202,"text":"We are small, distributed and fast on purpose, and that only holds while everyone here owns a real outcome. If you want a defined lane and a roadmap handed to you, we will frustrate you. If you would rather take a problem nobody has solved yet and carry it all the way to the end, we should talk.","s":{"font":"Instrument Sans 500 16px/22.4px ls:-0.16px","color":"rgb(18, 32, 35)","ta":"left"}},{"d":7,"tag":"div","x":56,"y":1403,"w":206,"h":19,"s":{"flex":"column jc:flex-start ai:normal","maxw":"564px"}},{"d":8,"tag":"p","x":56,"y":1403,"w":206,"h":19,"text":"Lisa and Andrei, co-founders","s":{"font":"Instrument Sans 400 16px/19.2px ls:-0.16px","color":"rgb(18, 32, 35)","ta":"left"}},{"d":4,"tag":"div","n":"Features","x":56,"y":1471,"w":278,"h":224,"s":{"flex":"row jc:flex-start ai:flex-start","gap":"48px","maxw":"1440px","ov":"hidden"}},{"d":6,"tag":"div","n":"Topics-card","x":56,"y":1471,"w":278,"h":224,"s":{"pad":"24px","flex":"column jc:flex-start ai:flex-start","gap":"8px","rad":"32px","ov":"hidden"}},{"d":7,"tag":"div","x":56,"y":1471,"w":278,"h":224,"s":{"rad":"32px"}},{"d":8,"tag":"img","x":56,"y":1471,"w":278,"h":224,"src":"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jI4UkRHradpPJjCWsLuzyY5YOo.png?scale-do